  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Golden Hour — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you have gained the limited ability to reverse time. As a Full Turn Action (Action + Bonus Action + Movement) for 8 cursed energy you can strike a supreme pose and rewind time by 6 seconds, taking all creatures and objects within 100 ft back in time 1 round to the start of your previous turn.<br />\n Any damage taken or cursed energy spent (other than this technique) during that round is undone and all creatures are taken back to where they were 6 seconds ago as long as it is within the 100 ft radius of the rewind.</p>",
